    <string name="settings_about">About</string>
    <string name="settings_about_body">This app is a training aid and self-tracking tool. It does not diagnose, and it does not promise treatment results. Training levels are a product pace, not a medical muscle-strength grade.</string>
    <string name="settings_compliance">Levels and counts are product settings, not a medical prescription or muscle-strength diagnosis. More repetitions are not necessarily better. Stop if you feel fatigue, pain, persistent tension or changes in urination, and consult a doctor or a pelvic floor physiotherapy professional. No treatment for incontinence, ED, PE or sexual-function benefit is guaranteed. 240 is a product counting cap, not a medical safety guarantee.</string>
    <string name="settings_offline">All data stays on this device. No network, no upload.</string>

